@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+Add threshold support to frai eval
+
+- Add --threshold <metric>=<min> option to frai eval CLI (repeatable)
+- Implement threshold validation in frai-core generateReport()
+- Thresholds fail when metric score is null or below minimum
+- Exit code 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass or no thresholds
+- Exit code 2 for malformed/invalid thresholds (usage error)
+- JSON reports include top-level 'passed' field and 'thresholds' list
+- Markdown reports include "Thresholds" section with PASS/FAIL status
+- Without --threshold, behavior unchanged (backward compatible)
+- SDK users can pass thresholds object to generateReport()
+- Add comprehensive tests for threshold functionality
+- Update README with CLI docs and SDK example
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
